          "content": "A) Order the pork\n\n**Explanation:** \nChoosing this option produces the best overall outcome for all parties involved. Denying the request causes the pig genuine emotional distress and denies it the fulfillment of its core preference, resulting in a net increase in negative experience. Because the animal has lived well, will experience no physical pain, and desires this outcome above all else, granting its wish maximizes satisfaction and minimizes suffering.",
